# A fastening product added to neighbourhood.ttl for the purchased-item tests, in the shape the parts and offers CONSTRUCTs
# produce: each site's purchased parts with their item class, standard and nominal size as stored, their Atelier core tag and membership,
# and each site's supplier offers with their suppliers.
#   one M3 x 10 socket head cap screw bought under four standards and two units: de-screw (DIN 912, mm), fr-screw
#     (NF EN ISO 4762, mm), uk-screw (BS EN ISO 4762, in), es-screw (UNE-EN ISO 4762, in); uk-spare-screw is the same screw, releasable
#     to UK only; es-long-screw is an M3 x 12 (2 mm longer), fr-countersunk a standard no concept carries
#   two M4 cap screws whose sites state no length: de-stud (DIN 912) and es-stud (UNE-EN ISO 4762); de-nut (DIN 934) and
#     es-nut (UNE-EN ISO 4032), standards no concept carries
#   de-bearing: two preferred offers, 10 days from L-01 and 35 days from L-02, and a 60-day offer from L-03 that is not preferred
#   Kestrelmoor Fastener Supply Ltd is listed by UK (S02) and ES (P-01)
